2:T491,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice","headline":"Turkish Bird - David Attenborough","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.webp"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Turkish Airlines used a David Attenborough style voiceover for their fun video. A parody narrated by the UK’s most in-demand Attenborough voice. ","datePublished":"2023-06-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2023-06-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["parody voice"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice.jpg"}}4:T4a8,<h2>How do you get a David Attenborough-style voiceover?</h2>
<p>As a <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice" title="David Attenborough Style Voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">British Male Voiceover</a> artist, this has been one of my most popular character impressions. Turkish Airlines approached me to bring their "Turkish Bird" video to life in the iconic style of <strong>Sir David Attenborough</strong>.</p>
<p>This wasn’t my first time voicing in that iconic tone, I’ve also done it for the <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/horizon-zero-dawn-voice" title="Horizon Zero Dawn Attenborough Voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Horizon Zero Dawn video game trailer</a> and the viral <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice" title="Cracking Ice – Attenborough Spoof" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cracking Ice spoof</a>.</p>
<p>And now, you can even generate your own mini-narration with my <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/attenborough-script-generator" title="Attenborough Style AI Script Tool" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Attenborough Script Generator</a>!</p>7:["slug","turkish-bird-attenborough-voice","d"]
