Airlines used a David Attenborough style voiceover for their fun video. A parody narrated by the UK’s most in-demand Attenborough voice. \"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Turkish Bird - David Attenborough"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Voice of Sir David Attenborough... well, almost. Here's a parody for Turkish Airlines.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/tips-for-becoming-a-voiceover-actor-navigating-ai-challenges","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Tips For Becoming a Voiceover Actor: ","aria-label":"Previous: Tips For Becoming a Voiceover Actor: ","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/arabella-harris-girl-child-voiceover-kid","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Arabella Harris – Child Girl Voiceover Artist","aria-label":"Next: Arabella Harris – Child Girl Voiceover Artist","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$4"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TC8zbjTOuJE","title":"Turkish Bird - David Attenborough","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice.jpg","alt":"david attenborough style voice for turkish airlines","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Turkish Bird - David Attenborough"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Why choose parody over the real thing?</h2>\r\n<p>Let’s be honest – Sir David’s not likely to narrate your TikTok or corporate explainer any time soon. That’s where I come in. My job is to recreate the sound, rhythm, and gravitas of his style… without ever claiming to be the man himself.</p>\r\n<p>It’s respectful, comedic, and highly effective. My clients come back time and again when they want <strong>nature doc-style narration</strong> with a wink to the audience.</p>"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2>Have a listen to the Turkish Bird campaign</h2>\r\n<p>Watch the video to hear how we made an aeroplane feel like a BBC documentary subject. It’s fun, it’s cheeky, and it worked beautifully.</p>\r\n<p>Need something similar? You can <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Style Voice Booking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">hire the same voice here</a>.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/attenborough-voice-og.webp","alt":"david attenborough style voice for turkish airlines","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>How to get David Attenborough’s voice (sort of)</h2>\r\n<p>If you’re after the <strong>style</strong> of David Attenborough for a video, game, or narration, I’d be happy to help – as long as it’s all above board. Please keep it fun, light, and respectful. No profanity. No deepfakes. And definitely no claiming to be him.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Attenborough%20Voice%20Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy now\">📧 Get in touch</a> and let’s see what we can create together.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Turkish Bird - David Attenborough","pageUrl":"turkish-bird-attenborough-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","838",{"href":"/little-monster-media-movie-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/little-monster-media-movie-voice.jpg","alt":"little-monster-media-movie-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Movie trailer - Little Monster Media"}]]}],["$","$L3","979",{"href":"/playmobil-pirate-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/pirate-voice.jpg","alt":"Playmobil Pirate Voice – British Male Character Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"British Male Voice for Playmobil Pirate Ad"}]]}],["$","$L3","653",{"href":"/star-wars-character-voices","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/star-wars-character-voices.jpg","alt":"star-wars-character-voices","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Star Wars character voices"}]]}]]}]}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L6",null,{"paral